    "summary": "No part of a model can end a move inside an enclosed part, up to 3\" above the ground, of a **terrain feature** with the [Solid](vsdata:core-rule/solid) rule, such as a **dense terrain feature**; small openings like doors or windows don’t help.\n\nThis stops parts of models jutting through to get around Solid’s visibility limits.",
